  "description": "Why I no longer hate the pouring rain: Eight sticky stories that came with the damp monsoon.\n\nOriginal Webtoon\n\n*1. {GL} Blessing in disguise: noppi, tima (III), notima*  \n**Original Webtoon:**  \nPostype, [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5074000987)\n\n*2. {GL} [Name of Emotion](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/y1bkvjt/the-name-of-emotions) (감정의 이름): Kang PM, Kang Eonni, Miss PM*  \n**Original Webtoon:**  \nPostype, [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5074000973)\n\n*3. {GL} Damp Ascension (승천은 축축하게): Jakbul*  \n**Original Webtoon:**  \nPostype, [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5074000981)\n\n*4. {GL} A Secret to a Rainy Day (비 오는 날 비밀 사이): Hongbaek*  \n**Original Webtoon:**  \nPostype, [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5074000985)\n\n*5. {GL} The Next-Door Neighbor Wants Me To Touch Her Because She's So Wet? (잔뜩 젖은 옆집 언니가 만져달라는데요?): [Cho Sangduck](https://www.mangaupdates.com/authors.html?id=39666982358)*  \n**Original Webtoon:**  \nPostype, [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5074000983)\n\n*6. {GL} [HOTTIE's HEEL](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/uqc7f0j/hottie-s-heel): Mundo, Gwanggyu, Team Glover Travelogue*  \n**Original Webtoon:**  \nPostype, [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5074000975)\n\n*7. {GL} Jinx Rain (징크스 레인): Yongnak*  \n**Original Webtoon:**  \nPostype, [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5074000977)\n\n*8. {GL} How to Survive the Rainy Season (장마에서 살아남는 방법): Willou*  \n**Original Webtoon:**  \nPostype, [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5074000979)",
